		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Utilisation de RETURNING]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=14205#p14205"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Donc si je fais </p><div class="quotebox"><blockquote><div><p>&lt;?php</p><p>$dbconnect=pg_connect(&quot;host=localhost dbname=Stanhome user=postgres password=ifesuh2m&quot;);</p><p> <br />&#160; &#160; $num_cli=$_POST[&#039;num_client&#039;];<br />&#160; &#160; $total=$_POST[&#039;total_ht&#039;];<br />&#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; $insert_commandes=&quot;INSERT INTO commandes (num_com, total_com, num_pers) VALUES (DEFAULT,&#039;&quot;.$total.&quot;&#039;,&#039;&quot;.$num_cli.&quot;&#039;) RETURNING&#160; num_com&quot;; // ?????</p><p>&#160; &#160;&#160; $result=pg_query($dbconnect, $insert_commandes);</p><p>&#160; &#160; <strong>while ($row = pg_fetch_array($result)) {<br />&#160; &#160; echo $row[&#039;num_com&#039;];<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; }</strong></p><p> <br />&#160; &#160;&#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; $insert_ok=true;<br />&#160; &#160; <br />foreach($_POST[&#039;num_produit&#039;] as $cle=&gt;$numproduit){<br />&#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; $qteproduit&#160; &#160; = $_POST[&#039;qte_produit&#039;][$cle];<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; $insert_composer=&quot;INSERT INTO composer VALUES (&#039;&quot;.$qteproduit.&quot;&#039;, &#039;&quot;.<strong>$row[&#039;num_com&#039;]</strong>.&quot;&#039;,&#039;&quot;.$numproduit.&quot;&#039;)&quot;;</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; if(!$insert_composer) {$insert_ok=false;}</p><br /><br /><p>&#160; &#160; //}<br />}<br />&#160; &#160; pg_query($dbconnect, $insert_composer);<br /> //message<br />&#160; &#160;&#160; if($insert_ok){<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; echo &quot;Commande enregistrée&quot;;<br />&#160; &#160; }else{<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; echo &quot;PB Commande non enregistrée&quot;;<br />&#160; &#160; }&#160; &#160; <br />?&gt;</p></div></blockquote></div><p>Cela fonctionne ? J&#039;ai un peu de mal à comprendre l&#039;idée là.</p>]]></content>
